            "\n",
            "\\myparagraph{Initialization.}\n",
            "Self-corrective learning begins with a generator $p_0(y_0|x)$, a corrector \n",
            "$p_\\theta(y'|y,x)$\n",
            ", a set of training prompts $X$, and a value function \n",
            "$v:\\mathcal Y \\rightarrow\\mathbb R$.\n",
